subckt dut (VDD VSS VB2 OUTPUT VB1 INPUT)
CB1 (net2 net0) capacitor c=1p
CF (net8 net9) capacitor c=1p
CIN (net1 INPUT) capacitor c=1p
COUT (OUTPUT net7) capacitor c=1p
LD1 (VDD net4) inductor l=1n
LD2 (VDD net5) inductor l=1n
LIN (net1 net9) inductor l=1n
LOUT (net6 net7) inductor l=1n
LS (net3 VSS) inductor l=1n
Lshunt (net1 VB1) inductor l=1n
M1 (net2 net9 net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net6 net0 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RB2 (net0 VB2) resistor r=1k
RD1 (net4 net2) resistor r=1k
RD2 (net5 net6) resistor r=1k
RF (net2 net8) resistor r=1k
